OL,3,GNEWSASix in court on abduction and
OL,4,Afirearms charges after alleged
OL,5,AEdinburgh kidnap
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix people have appeared in court
OL,8,Fcharged with abduction, assault and
OL,9,Ffirearms offences after a 22-year-old
OL,10,Fman was allegedly kidnapped in
OL,11,FEdinburgh.
OL,13,FThe man was reportedly abducted at
OL,14,Fabout 22:30 last Thursday but was
OL,15,Ftraced the following day during a
OL,16,Fpolice operation in the East Lothian
OL,17,Fvillage of Longniddry.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
