OL,3,GNEWSASix in court on abduction and
OL,4,Afirearms charges after alleged
OL,5,AEdinburgh kidnap
OL,6,
OL,7,FBugra Has, 21, Achile Keita, 23,
OL,8,FMustafa Merghani, 22, Ashawn Studholme,
OL,9,F21, Robert McKinney, 45 and Danielle
OL,10,FWhyte, 40, appeared at Edinburgh
OL,11,FSheriff Court on Monday.
OL,13,FAll six made no plea to the charges and
OL,14,Fwere remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
